Installation and Dependencies

The library can be installed in one of the normal platform-specific folders for extensions. You can find out what these are by executing these two lines of code:

	Platform.userExtensionDir;
	Platform.systemExtensionDir;

See Using-Extensions for further details.

The library also has two dependencies which are required for full functionality. The first is Wouter Snouei's wslib, which is available as a Quark. You can install it by calling Quarks.gui, or executing the following and recompiling:

	"wslib".include;

The second is Josh Parmenter's collection of ambisonics UGens. These are available as part of the sc3-plugins package, which is available from: http://sc3-plugins.sourceforge.net/.